### 28. Get notifications / announcements (use-announcements → get_notifications)
POST {{host}}/make_request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "functionName": "get_notifications"
}

### 29. Register notification token (notification.service → insert_notification_token)
POST {{host}}/make_request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "functionName": "insert_notification_token",
  "emp_cd": "2009200083T",
  "device_token": "<expo push token>"
}

### 30. Unregister notification token (notification.service → insert_notification_token)
POST {{host}}/make_request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "functionName": "insert_notification_token",
  "emp_cd": "2009200083T",
  "token": "<expo push token>"
}

